{"seq":1,"slug":"biomarker-driven-trials","title":"博士临床研究 — 生物标志物驱动的试验设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/medicine/clinical-research-advanced/precision-medicine/biomarker-driven-trials","wordCount":1995,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"博士临床研究-生物标志物驱动的试验设计\">博士临床研究 — 生物标志物驱动的试验设计</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>生物标志物驱动的试验设计是精准医学从概念走向临床实践的方法论核心。通过分子标志物对患者进行分层或富集，研究者可以将&quot;对的药&quot;给&quot;对的人&quot;，在提高疗效信号的同时减少所需样本量。这种策略在肿瘤学中已催生出多个里程碑式审批——曲妥珠单抗（HER2+乳腺癌）、克唑替尼（ALK+非小细胞肺癌）和拉罗替尼（NTRK 融合泛癌种）。</p>\n<p>生物标志物的分类层次：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>预测性标志物（Predictive Biomarker）</strong>：预测特定治疗的疗效差异。如 HER2 过表达预测曲妥珠单抗获益</li>\n<li><strong>预后性标志物（Prognostic Biomarker）</strong>：预测疾病自然进程，与治疗无关。如肿瘤分期</li>\n<li><strong>药效学标志物（Pharmacodynamic Biomarker）</strong>：反映药物的生物学效应。如 PD-L1 表达在免疫检查点治疗后的变化</li>\n<li><strong>安全性标志物</strong>：预测不良反应风险。如 HLA-B*5701 预测阿巴卡韦超敏反应</li>\n</ul>\n<p>生物标志物从发现到临床应用的验证路径分为：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>分析验证（Analytical Validation）</strong>：检测方法的精确度、准确度、灵敏度和特异度</li>\n<li><strong>临床验证（Clinical Validation）</strong>：标志物与临床终点的关联强度</li>\n<li><strong>临床效用（Clinical Utility）</strong>：基于标志物的决策是否改善患者结局</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[候选标志物发现] --&gt; B[分析验证&lt;br/&gt;检测方法性能]&#10;    B --&gt; C[临床验证&lt;br/&gt;标志物-结局关联]&#10;    C --&gt; D[临床效用&lt;br/&gt;决策改善结局]&#10;    D --&gt; E[伴随诊断审批&lt;br/&gt;CDx]&#10;    E --&gt; F[药物-诊断联合标签]\">graph TD\n    A[候选标志物发现] --&gt; B[分析验证&lt;br/&gt;检测方法性能]\n    B --&gt; C[临床验证&lt;br/&gt;标志物-结局关联]\n    C --&gt; D[临床效用&lt;br/&gt;决策改善结局]\n    D --&gt; E[伴随诊断审批&lt;br/&gt;CDx]\n    E --&gt; F[药物-诊断联合标签]</pre><h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"富集设计-enrichment-design\">富集设计（Enrichment Design）</h3><p>富集设计只纳入标志物阳性的患者，所有入组者均接受随机化。这是最简单的标志物驱动设计。</p>\n<p><strong>优势</strong>：样本量需求大幅降低（取决于阳性亚组的富集效应量 vs. 全人群效应量之比），信噪比高。</p>\n<p><strong>局限</strong>：无法评估治疗在标志物阴性人群中的效果，无法验证标志物本身的预测价值（因为缺少阴性对照）。</p>\n<p><strong>样本量计算</strong>：设全人群效应量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mtext>all</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta_{\\text{all}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">all</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，阳性亚群效应量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mo>+</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta_+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9028em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，阳性率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span>，则富集设计相对于全人群设计的样本量比为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>RR</mtext><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>π</mi></mfrac><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>δ</mi><mtext>all</mtext></msub><msub><mi>δ</mi><mo>+</mo></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RR}_n = \\frac{1}{\\pi} \\times \\left(\\frac{\\delta_{\\text{all}}}{\\delta_+}\\right)^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RR</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.604em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">all</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8943em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.654em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.9029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mo>+</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>δ</mi><mtext>all</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta_+ = 2\\delta_{\\text{all}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9028em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">all</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi = 0.3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.3</span></span></span></span></span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>RR</mtext><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.83</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RR}_n = 0.83</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RR</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.83</span></span></span></span></span>——即使只有 30% 的患者符合标准，富集设计仍可节省 17% 的样本量。</p>\n<h3 id=\"生物标志物策略设计-biomarker-strategy-design\">生物标志物策略设计（Biomarker-Strategy Design）</h3><p>患者先按标志物状态分层，然后在标志物指导臂中根据标志物结果分配治疗，在非指导臂中随机分配治疗。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分配</th>\n<th>标志物指导臂</th>\n<th>标准臂</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>标志物 +</td>\n<td>实验治疗</td>\n<td>随机（实验/标准）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标志物 −</td>\n<td>标准治疗</td>\n<td>随机（实验/标准）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这种设计评估的是标志物指导策略的整体效果（不仅是药物本身），但通常需要非常大的样本量。</p>\n<h3 id=\"自适应富集设计\">自适应富集设计</h3><p>自适应富集设计允许在试验中期根据标志物亚组间的疗效差异动态调整入组标准：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>阶段 1</strong>：所有患者（标志物 +/−）均入组，1:1 随机化</li>\n<li><strong>中期分析</strong>：评估标志物 + 和 − 亚组的条件功效</li>\n<li><strong>适应</strong>：若标志物 − 亚组获益不足，后续仅入组标志物 + 患者</li>\n<li><strong>最终分析</strong>：使用闭合检验程序（如交叉-联合检验）在全人群和亚组层面同时控制 I 类错误</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>H</mi><mn>0</mn><mi>F</mi></msubsup><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>全人群</mtext></msub><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msubsup><mi>H</mi><mn>0</mn><mi>S</mi></msubsup><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>亚组</mtext></msub><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_0^F: \\theta_{\\text{全人群}} \\leq 0, \\quad H_0^S: \\theta_{\\text{亚组}} \\leq 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1383em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">全人群</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1383em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">亚组</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>只有当两个假设均被拒绝时才声明亚组有效性。这种闭合程序确保总体 familywise 错误率控制在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 水平。</p>\n<h3 id=\"篮式试验与伞式试验的统计挑战\">篮式试验与伞式试验的统计挑战</h3><p><strong>篮式试验</strong>中的核心问题是跨篮子信息借力。若一种靶向治疗在 5 种不同癌种的 BRAF V600E 突变患者中评估，完全独立分析将丧失效率，但完全合并分析将忽略组织特异性。</p>\n<p>贝叶斯层级模型提供折中方案：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>μ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>τ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>∼</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>τ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_k | \\mu, \\tau^2 \\sim N(\\mu, \\tau^2), \\quad k = 1, \\ldots, K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个篮子的治疗效应，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 是总体均值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>τ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 控制篮子间异质性。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>τ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau^2 \\to 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 时趋向完全合并，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>τ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau^2 \\to \\infty</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span></span></span></span></span> 时趋向独立分析。数据自适应地估计 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>τ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，实现&quot;需要多少就借多少&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>伞式试验</strong>的挑战在于多个亚型-治疗配对的多重性控制，以及当某些亚型罕见时的信息不足问题。</p>\n<h3 id=\"伴随诊断-cdx-的开发协同\">伴随诊断（CDx）的开发协同</h3><p>伴随诊断（Companion Diagnostic）是与特定药物联合审批的体外诊断设备。药物和 CDx 的联合开发要求：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时间节点</th>\n<th>药物开发</th>\n<th>CDx 开发</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>I/II 期</td>\n<td>确定候选标志物</td>\n<td>分析验证（精确度、灵敏度）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>注册试验设计</td>\n<td>标志物纳入试验方案</td>\n<td>临床试验检测由 CDx 完成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BLA/NDA 提交</td>\n<td>疗效和安全性数据</td>\n<td>PMA/510(k) 同步提交</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>审批</td>\n<td>药物标签限定标志物阳性</td>\n<td>CDx 获批用于患者筛选</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>FDA 和 EMA 均要求注册试验中使用的检测方法与最终商业化 CDx 具有桥接验证数据。若检测方法在试验过程中变更，需提供方法学比较数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>一种新型 CDK4/6 抑制剂拟在 HR+/HER2− 晚期乳腺癌中开展 III 期试验。有初步证据显示 Rb 蛋白表达水平可能是预测性标志物。设计两种备选方案：(a) 全人群设计 + 亚组分析，(b) 自适应富集设计。比较两种方案的样本量、决策灵活性和 CDx 开发路径。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某篮式试验评估 NTRK 抑制剂在 8 种癌种中的活性。前 4 种癌种各入组 20 人，应答率分别为 75%、60%、65%、70%。后 4 种各入组 10 人，应答率为 20%、30%、25%、10%。请讨论使用贝叶斯层级模型时后 4 种癌种估计值将如何被前 4 种&quot;拉动&quot;，以及这种借力的合理性边界。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>设计一个伴随诊断的桥接验证研究：临床试验中使用了实验室开发检测（LDT），现在需要验证商业化 IVD 与 LDT 的一致性。确定样本量、一致性指标（PPA/NPA/OPA）和可接受的一致性阈值。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>液体活检（ctDNA）正在挑战组织活检在标志物检测中的垄断地位。讨论液体活检作为 CDx 的优势（微创、动态监测、异质性捕捉）和局限（灵敏度、标准化），以及它对试验设计（入组速度、实时分层）的影响。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Simon (2010)</strong>：<em>Clinical trial designs for evaluating the medical utility of prognostic and predictive biomarkers in oncology</em>（Personalized Medicine）— 标志物试验设计分类学</li>\n<li><strong>Freidlin et al. (2010)</strong>：<em>Adaptive clinical trial designs for biomarker-driven treatment strategies</em>（Annals of Oncology）— 自适应富集设计综述</li>\n<li><strong>FDA Guidance</strong>：<em>Enrichment Strategies for Clinical Trials to Support Determination of Effectiveness of Human Drugs and Biological Products</em> (2019)</li>\n<li><strong>Drilon et al. (2018)</strong>：<em>Efficacy of Larotrectinib in TRK Fusion–Positive Cancers</em>（NEJM）— 泛癌种篮式试验的里程碑研究</li>\n<li><strong>FDA-AACR-ASCO 联合工作坊报告</strong>：关于主方案试验中 CDx 共同开发的监管路径</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>生物标志物驱动的试验设计通过分子分层将患者匹配到最可能获益的治疗方案，是精准医学临床转化的方法论引擎。从简单的富集设计到复杂的自适应富集和篮式/伞式试验，设计复杂度与灵活性递增，但统计学基础一致——在多重假设检验框架下控制错误率，同时通过层级模型在亚组间借力。伴随诊断的联合开发是标志物驱动策略成功的必要条件，其分析验证和桥接验证构成了监管审评的关键证据。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"博士临床研究 — 生物标志物驱动的试验设计","id":"博士临床研究-生物标志物驱动的试验设计"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"富集设计（Enrichment Design）","id":"富集设计-enrichment-design"},{"level":3,"text":"生物标志物策略设计（Biomarker-Strategy Design）","id":"生物标志物策略设计-biomarker-strategy-design"},{"level":3,"text":"自适应富集设计","id":"自适应富集设计"},{"level":3,"text":"篮式试验与伞式试验的统计挑战","id":"篮式试验与伞式试验的统计挑战"},{"level":3,"text":"伴随诊断（CDx）的开发协同","id":"伴随诊断-cdx-的开发协同"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"博士临床研究 — 患者报告结局与数字终点","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/medicine/clinical-research-advanced/real-world-evidence/pros-digital-endpoints"},"next":{"title":"博士临床研究 — 药物基因组学与个体化给药","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/medicine/clinical-research-advanced/precision-medicine/pharmacogenomics-dosing"}}